You can be so bad at the game that an early WoW won't save you; you can be
so good that you'd ascend anyway; that doesn't mean that in the gap
between novice and Marvin there aren't a lot of players for whom an early
WoW makes a possible ascension into an effectively guaranteed one. Even a
0:1 WoW is 4 wishes; with SDSM, a CoMR, speed boots and (um) something,
you should have a free run to the Castle at least - completely bypassing
the challenge of the early game, which is where the bulk of the challenge
_is_.

