I have only died once past the Castle, in Rodney's Tower, but I may be
atypical. Certainly now we have the stylish entrance technique there's no
excuse at all for dying in the Sanctum - on my recent ascension I killed
two monsters there and if I hadn't fatfingered a move it would only have
been the necessary one.

People die on Astral, but of course the word "Pestilence" is missing from
the above. I admit Astral isn't quite the walk in the park that much of
the game is, but that doesn't change the way that 99% of what you face in
the late game is speedbumps.
